# Cipher Family Field Guide — Taxonomy, Fingerprints, and What They Narrow

*A literature survey of how the relevant cipher families behave, how professionals
fingerprint and identify them from ciphertext alone, and what that knowledge —
plus fresh measurements on the Eye corpus — narrows in our formula. Sources at
the end; every corpus number in this document is either reproduced by the inline
script (§5) or cited to a repo report.*

Repo placement: `cipher_data/`. Companion docs: `STATE_OF_THE_SOLVE.md` (status),
